OL,3,GNEWSAThe people on standby when a storm
OL,4,Astrikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile most people are preparing to stay
OL,7,Findoors as another storm approaches,
OL,8,Fothers are getting ready to head
OL,9,Fstraight into it.
OL,11,FStorm Boelo is expected to bring strong
OL,12,Fwinds and disruption to parts of
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland this weekend.
OL,15,FFor those tasked with keeping people
OL,16,Fsafe and dealing with the damage,
OL,17,Fsevere weather can bring long hours,
OL,18,Fdangerous conditions and calls for help
OL,19,Fat any moment.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
