OL,3,GNEWSAThe people on standby when a storm
OL,4,Astrikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn preparation for the storm, the
OL,7,FDepartment for Infrastructure said
OL,8,Ftheir teams have been checking and
OL,9,Fclearing road gullies, monitoring river
OL,10,Flevels and tidal surges, and deploying
OL,11,Fa portion of temporary flood defences.
